<title>SINGAPORE: Scotts chairman offers resignation.</title>
<headline>Scotts chairman offers resignation.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotts Holdings Ltd has received a letter of resignation on September 20 from executive chairman Ameerali Rajabali Jumabhoy, a stock exchange statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>The statement said the company was seeking legal advice and would consider the matter at its next board meeting.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
